# Brand Context (IP Isolation)
# Ignore all brand IP and nested brand/project git worlds.
# Track only the versioned scaffold. NEVER force-add ignored paths
# (git add -f) into the toolkit repository. Never add brands as submodules.
/BRANDS/*
!/BRANDS/README.md
!/BRANDS/_TEMPLATE/
!/BRANDS/_TEMPLATE/**

# Page-template catalog (ADR-3.7)
# Track scaffold only. Niche templates are nested git worlds — never submodules.
/_TEMPLATES/*
!/_TEMPLATES/README.md
!/_TEMPLATES/_TEMPLATE_SPEC.md
!/_TEMPLATES/_TEMPLATE/
!/_TEMPLATES/_TEMPLATE/**

# Toolkit-wide /history/ is versioned in this repo (not brand IP).
# Brand and project history folders live under /BRANDS/ and stay ignored.

# Provisioned locally by setup.sh (ignore contents so allowlisted trees can be tracked)
/.agents/skills/*
# Bundled in-repo exception (ADR-2.6) — setup must never delete this tree
!/.agents/skills/page-templates/
!/.agents/skills/page-templates/**
/vendor/
TOOLS.md
skills-lock.json

# Jataí
INBOX/
OUTBOX/
.jatai.lock
.jatai